menu "Demo"

config PKG_CANOPENNODE_CIA401_DEVICE_RTT_DEMO
    bool "Enable software-only RT-Thread CiA 401 Device demo"
    default n
    depends on PKG_CANOPENNODE_CIA401_DEVICE_RTT_THREAD
    depends on PKG_CANOPENNODE_CIA401_DEVICE_RTT_AUTOSTART
    help
        Register a bounded software I/O backend for DI/DO/AI/AO. The backend
        owns no hardware and is intended only for lifecycle/protocol bring-up.
        Because no remote output-setting peer exists, the demo models the CiA 401
        output-supervision prerequisite as already established. Product code must
        classify the real Heartbeat/node-guard relationship instead.
        The application-generated Object Dictionary must contain every mandatory
        and enabled optional CiA 401 object; this option does not replace or
        rewrite the selected product/demo Object Dictionary.

endmenu
